- The address input keeps `inputmode="url"`, `aria-label="App URL"`, `Enter` = go, `Esc` = revert.
- No focus styles removed; `btn-ghost` focus ring stays visible.

### Anti-patterns avoided
- ❌ Gating an action behind a value-equality check whose two sides share a fallback (the exact cause of this bug).
- ❌ Reaching into the iframe DOM directly from the menu — navigation still flows through the store (`lastUrl`) so it survives reloads and layout restore.
- ❌ Inventing new store state/actions — `navToken` rides along the existing `updateAppParams` path.

